{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHJDDV4SXY2YWRJ1JZXB","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHJDQRMP9NPW8D857C2M","name_zh":"勇氣狂暴","name_en":"Valiant Fury","alphabet":"V","source_access":{"kind":"expansion","sources":["完美戰力","萬法大全"],"explicit_sources":["完美戰力","萬法大全"],"inferred_sources":[],"raw_source_labels":["完美戰力","萬法大全"],"default_character_creation":false},"levels":[{"class":"勇氣","level":5,"note":""}],"level_text_raw":"勇氣 5","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"變化系","subschool":"","descriptors":[],"components":"語言，姿勢，法器","casting_time":"一個標準動作","range":"近距（25 英尺+5 英尺/每 2 等級）","target":"一個活著的生物","area":"","effect":"","duration":"1 輪/等級","saving_throw":"意志，通過則無效（無害）","spell_resistance":"可（無害）","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"受術者的力量和體質獲得+4 士氣加值，意志豁免獲得+2 士氣加值。\n另外，當受術者做整輪攻擊的時候，它可以使用它握持的任何一件武器，做一次額外的攻\n擊。該攻擊使用受術者的完整攻擊加值，以及任何其它的修正（本效果不與其它類似效果疊\n加，比如加速術（Haste）提供的效果。本效果也並非提供更多的動作，因此你不能用它來\n在該輪施展第二個法術或進行其它的動作）。","description_en":null,"source_pages":[1082,1082],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":[],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"0a3dde2910775e163582a270316831f6496264fc21bbdee232df9901de902339","heading":"勇氣狂暴（Valiant Fury）（完美戰力）（萬法大全）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHJDY71Y86R2MZ38ZKRC","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHJDTSTAY8FG6MT4AR3J","name_zh":"忠勇駒騎","name_en":"Valiant Steed","alphabet":"V","source_access":{"kind":"expansion","sources":["好人書"],"explicit_sources":["好人書"],"inferred_sources":[],"raw_source_labels":["好人書"],"default_character_creation":false},"levels":[{"class":"聖潔","level":6,"note":""}],"level_text_raw":"聖潔 6","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"咒法系","subschool":"呼喚","descriptors":["善良"],"components":"言語、姿勢、祭獻","casting_time":"一小時","range":"近距（25 呎+5 呎/每兩等級）","target":"","area":"","effect":"呼喚一隻飛馬或獨角獸","duration":"立即；見敘述","saving_throw":"無","spell_resistance":"不可","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"此法術能呼喚屬於崇善神祇法爾賴恩的特別侍從－可以是飛馬或獨角獸－到她所在的\n位置。\n他們會在接下來的一年為你服務，你可以在任何時候將他們送回去。他們是有智慧的\n生物，能夠交給他們各種不同的工作。即使是作為座騎，他們也不見得會同意所有的要求，\n或是在施法者的視線之外擔負過度重大的責任。\n若你又使用同樣的法術召喚其它生物，那你原本召來的生物就會回到他的家園。\n祭獻：1d3 點力量吸取。","description_en":null,"source_pages":[1081,1081],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":[],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"5664c88ffaf5af3d262070d18832db0887aa73789a69379dc4b7a82f7527c629","heading":"忠勇駒騎（Valiant Steed）（好人書）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHJDFFCFMX3M79GNS9QV","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHJDHTSDN23C0GM5SC1B","name_zh":"吸血鬼之觸","name_en":"Vampiric Touch","alphabet":"V","source_access":{"kind":"basic","sources":[],"explicit_sources":[],"inferred_sources":[],"raw_source_labels":[],"default_character_creation":true},"levels":[{"class":"術士/法師","level":3,"note":""}],"level_text_raw":"術士/法師 3","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"死靈系","subschool":"","descriptors":[],"components":"言語，姿勢","casting_time":"1 個標準動作","range":"接觸","target":"被接觸的生物","area":"","effect":"","duration":"立即/1 小時，見下文","saving_throw":"無","spell_resistance":"可","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"你必須成功通過一次近戰接觸攻擊。如果成功，那麼你的接觸會造成每兩個施法者等級\n1d6 點傷害（最大 10d6）。你獲得等同於此傷害的暫時生命值。但獲得的生命值不能超過\n受害者的目前生命值+10 點，因為這已經足以殺死對方。暫時生命值會在 1 小時後消失。","description_en":null,"source_pages":[1081,1082],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":[],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"ef56ebf11c7e9375fc2c74e3a009f571d2f92472e4bbc99cd972d51db22b8d26","heading":"吸血鬼之觸（Vampiric Touch ）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHJDBZ1S60PF2M5QF99B","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHJD28DZQVGXD4XX7XET","name_zh":"消解武器","name_en":"Vanishing Weapon","alphabet":"V","source_access":{"kind":"expansion","sources":["好人書"],"explicit_sources":["好人書"],"inferred_sources":[],"raw_source_labels":["好人書"],"default_character_creation":false},"levels":[{"class":"術士/法師","level":5,"note":""}],"level_text_raw":"術士/法師 5","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"防護系","subschool":"","descriptors":[],"components":"言語、姿勢","casting_time":"一個標準動作","range":"觸碰","target":"觸碰到的武器","area":"","effect":"","duration":"一分鐘/每等級","saving_throw":"無；見敘述","spell_resistance":"不可","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"此法術能將武器包裹在一道微弱的光芒中。\n除了造成一般傷害以外，這把武器還能驅散任何由咒法系（召喚）或幻術系（幽影幻\n覺）所喚來的生物或擬似生物。這必需通過解除檢定（1d20+施法者等級）對抗 11+生物召\n喚者或創造者的施法者等級。若「消解武器」是遠端武器，那武器所使用的彈藥也會得到\n相同的能力。\n召喚來的生物或擬似生物若被命令去觸碰「消解武器」，那他們同樣會被解消掉。\n此法術對呼喚來的生物沒有效果。","description_en":null,"source_pages":[1081,1081],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":[],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"bc37e6ca14141c1721525953608bd710109084172e819922ba9fb20e5388c155","heading":"消解武器（Vanishing Weapon ）（好人書）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
