{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHJDXTHXK59FJMRK2W1H","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHJDVYCE20FNKK85N48J","name_zh":"隱匿之紗","name_en":"Veil","alphabet":"V","source_access":{"kind":"basic","sources":[],"explicit_sources":[],"inferred_sources":[],"raw_source_labels":[],"default_character_creation":true},"levels":[{"class":"吟游詩人","level":6,"note":""},{"class":"術士/法師","level":6,"note":""}],"level_text_raw":"吟游詩人 6，術士/法師 6","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"幻術系","subschool":"五官幻術","descriptors":[],"components":"言語，姿勢","casting_time":"1 個標準動作","range":"遠距（400 英尺+40 英尺/等級）","target":"一個或多個生物，生物間距不超過 30 英尺","area":"","effect":"","duration":"專注+1 小時/等級（可解消）","saving_throw":"意志，通過則無效；見下文","spell_resistance":"可，見下文","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"你可以瞬間改變受術者的外觀，之後在法術持續時間內它將保持不變。你可以讓受術\n者變成任何你希望的東西。他的外觀、觸感和氣味都會發生相應的變化。若受術者死亡，\n則回復原樣。你必須先同過易容檢定才能複製出特定人物的樣貌。該法術可以讓你在檢定\n時獲得+10 的加值。\n受術者若不願接受此法術則可進行意志豁免或使用法術抗力，通過則法術無效。若有\n人與受術者發生互動，可進行意志豁免，通過則不相信，並看穿幻覺，但法術抗力對此無\n效。","description_en":null,"source_pages":[1082,1083],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":[],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"21624ba80d5a119817ab582d9d0b1ec7af971910638d739d78cc58231455872c","heading":"隱匿之紗（Veil）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHJD4W3V029WGNRWE2J8","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHJD36ATYRE5RPZQXBEV","name_zh":"陰影面紗","name_en":"Veil Of Shadow","alphabet":"V","source_access":{"kind":"expansion","sources":["萬法大全"],"explicit_sources":["萬法大全"],"inferred_sources":[],"raw_source_labels":["萬法大全"],"default_character_creation":false},"levels":[{"class":"刺客","level":2,"note":""},{"class":"牧師","level":2,"note":""},{"class":"術士/法師","level":2,"note":""},{"class":"黑暗衛士","level":2,"note":""}],"level_text_raw":"刺客 2，黑暗衛士 2，牧師 2，術士/法師 2","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"塑能系","subschool":"","descriptors":["黑暗"],"components":"Ｖ、Ｓ","casting_time":"一個標準動作","range":"個人","target":"自己","area":"","effect":"","duration":"1 分鐘/每等級","saving_throw":"","spell_resistance":"","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"你念出咒語，黯色的能量從地下卷騰而起讓你在敵人的面前隱去。\n小股黑暗的漩渦隱藏著你的身形，使你保持掩蔽狀態。法術影響期間，攻擊你的人會\n有 20%的失手機率，即使他擁有黑暗視覺也一樣。\n這個法術在日光或者三級或以上的光明法術的影響區域會失效。\n識破隱形不能看穿這個法術，但是真實目光可以。","description_en":null,"source_pages":[1083,1083],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":[],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"e2112a98345cf721de8fb9901e169bf162d1e2061a603fdb4eb48214cb46adc2","heading":"陰影面紗（Veil Of Shadow）（萬法大全）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHJD81ZBKX98WDA0HZKJ","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHJDRDK0NQATER11QSPZ","name_zh":"亡者面紗","name_en":"Veil Of Undeath","alphabet":"V","source_access":{"kind":"expansion","sources":["死者之書"],"explicit_sources":["死者之書"],"inferred_sources":[],"raw_source_labels":["死者之書"],"default_character_creation":false},"levels":[{"class":"牧師","level":8,"note":""},{"class":"術士/法師","level":8,"note":""}],"level_text_raw":"牧師 8，術士/法師 8","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"死靈系","subschool":"","descriptors":["邪惡"],"components":"言語，姿勢，材料","casting_time":"1 個標準動作","range":"自身","target":"","area":"","effect":"自己","duration":"10 分鐘/每等級","saving_throw":"","spell_resistance":"","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"藉由此法術，你獲得許多不死生物的特性。法術持續期間，你免疫心智影響效果和毒素，\n睡眠，麻痹，震懾，死亡，疾病，重擊額外傷害，淤傷，巨創致死，屬性吸取，能量吸取，\n疲乏，力竭，身體屬性傷害，以及需要作強韌豁免的效果，除非它是無害的或對物體有效的。你也\n不再需要呼吸，飲食，睡眠。\n在法術持續期，你的體質屬性變為－－。你將失去所有體質獎勵帶來的生命點數（最少每\n個 HD 不會低於 1 點生命）。若你原本的體質修正為負值，你也不會得到補償生命力。\n如同不死生物，你會被治療法術傷害而被傷害法術治療。\n你不能通過此法術獲得不死生物生物類型。\n法術材料：完美奧術：價值 1,000gp 的黑色藍寶石（A black sapphire worth 1,000gp）\n萬法大全：僵屍的手指","description_en":null,"source_pages":[1083,1083],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":[],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"6c36de5658690f3044298b2d3e4847dbe9e65d52d977969a4306700a48440fd6","heading":"亡者面紗（Veil Of Undeath）（死者之書）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHJDHGB54P9YWR0H6W5N","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHJDN4K5K6SDQ1T67AVD","name_zh":"復仇光環","name_en":"Vengeance Halo","alphabet":"V","source_access":{"kind":"expansion","sources":["好人書"],"explicit_sources":["好人書"],"inferred_sources":[],"raw_source_labels":["好人書"],"default_character_creation":false},"levels":[{"class":"牧師","level":6,"note":""},{"class":"神譴","level":6,"note":""}],"level_text_raw":"牧師 6，神譴 6","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"防護系","subschool":"","descriptors":[],"components":"言語、姿勢、法器、禁制","casting_time":"一個標準動作","range":"近距（25 呎+5 呎/每兩等級）","target":"一個善良陣營的生物；見敘述","area":"","effect":"","duration":"一分鐘/每等級","saving_throw":"無或反射通過則減半；見敘述","spell_resistance":"不可","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"由神聖力量構成的光環出現在善良生物的頭頂上，直到法術中止或是該生物被殺（hp\n降到-10）為止。\n在這種狀況發生時，光環會立刻消散，變成弧狀的神能襲向殺死目標的生物，造成每施法\n者等級 1d6 點（最高到 20d6 點）傷害。該生物能進行反射檢定使傷害減半。「復仇光環」會\n在能量散發後消失，法術也會立刻結束。\n禁制要素：在施展此法術前一周，你不能飲用任何酒精飲品","description_en":null,"source_pages":[1083,1084],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":[],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"7fd4464283d88ec571d7d123777b7249154ced60ec1ff1c323bbc7b71c858b5c","heading":"復仇光環（Vengeance Halo）（好人書）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
