{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHJEX45QR54S80XY1QJC","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHJE1R9S4AVQA87DS4XJ","name_zh":"天旋地轉","name_en":"Vertigo","alphabet":"V","source_access":{"kind":"expansion","sources":["PHB2"],"explicit_sources":["PHB2"],"inferred_sources":[],"raw_source_labels":["PHB2"],"default_character_creation":false},"levels":[{"class":"吟游詩人","level":2,"note":""},{"class":"欺瞞者","level":2,"note":""},{"class":"術士/法師","level":2,"note":""}],"level_text_raw":"吟游詩人 2，欺瞞者 2，術士/法師 2","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"幻術系","subschool":"魅影幻覺","descriptors":["影響心靈","恐懼"],"components":"言語、姿勢","casting_time":"一個標準動作","range":"近距（25 呎+5 呎/每兩等級）","target":"一個活體生物","area":"","effect":"","duration":"1 輪/每等級（解消）","saving_throw":"意志過則不相信","spell_resistance":"不可","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"你用向下墜落的幻覺攤瘓了目標。\n此法術能讓目標昏眩，讓他感覺腳下的地面正在下降。目標每輪開始時都必需用一個移動\n動作進行難度 10 的平衡感檢定，失敗則無法移動，若檢定結果在 5 以下則會倒地。同時目\n標的攻擊與豁免檢定會受到-2 減值。飛行生物對抗此法術的豁免能得到+4 加值，而且無需\n進行平衡感檢定。","description_en":null,"source_pages":[1084,1084],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":[],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"f118d00b11be8caa51384833858241ebfb91efa4ef5f52f1e162cc97174cf3bd","heading":"天旋地轉（Vertigo）（PHB2）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHJE9JJJ0G7CMYTASGQE","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHJE7JN6BQ06E2R6QDY8","name_zh":"暈眩之域","name_en":"Vertigo Field","alphabet":"V","source_access":{"kind":"expansion","sources":["PHB2"],"explicit_sources":["PHB2"],"inferred_sources":[],"raw_source_labels":["PHB2"],"default_character_creation":false},"levels":[{"class":"欺瞞者","level":3,"note":""},{"class":"術士/法師","level":3,"note":""}],"level_text_raw":"欺瞞者 3，術士/法師 3","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"幻術系","subschool":"魅影幻覺","descriptors":[],"components":"言語、姿勢","casting_time":"一個標準動作","range":"中距（100 呎+10 呎/每等級）","target":"","area":"半徑 20 呎擴散範圍","effect":"","duration":"1 輪/每等級","saving_throw":"強韌過則減半；見敘述","spell_resistance":"可","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"你用創造一個充滿了各類旋轉圖樣的空間，這些圖樣有著不同色彩、光線及運動方式。\n處於範圍內的生物因這樣密集超載的感官轟炸而陷入暈眩。此法術能創造一個充滿幻術的區\n域，妨礙所有進入此區域生物的感官及行動。這個區域內是一個艱困的環境，在範圍內進行攻\n擊有 20%的失手率。處於範圍內的生物在自己的回合開始時必需進行強韌檢定，否則便會陷入\n反胃狀態，只要生物在豁免檢定中失敗，就不需要再進行豁免檢定來對抗此效果。在施展法術\n時，你可以指定讓某些同伴不受反胃效果影響，數量等同于你的施法者等級。這些同伴一樣受\n法術製造出來的環境影響，因此他們一樣有 20%的攻擊失手率。","description_en":null,"source_pages":[1084,1085],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":[],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"8d1df6c4fffb49b21dacf4f589f46df711cd10b8f9cc00dc448fd5cc51215104","heading":"暈眩之域（Vertigo Field）（PHB2）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHJEF4HW30TFKZKWGW5N","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHJE9JF4GTBA8VM2NBNK","name_zh":"警醒睡眠","name_en":"Vigilant Slumber","alphabet":"V","source_access":{"kind":"expansion","sources":["完美巫師"],"explicit_sources":["完美巫師"],"inferred_sources":[],"raw_source_labels":["完美巫師"],"default_character_creation":false},"levels":[{"class":"刺客","level":1,"note":""},{"class":"吟游詩人","level":1,"note":""},{"class":"術士/法師","level":1,"note":""}],"level_text_raw":"術士/法師 1，刺客 1，吟游詩人 1","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"預言系","subschool":"","descriptors":[],"components":"V,S","casting_time":"1 輪","range":"個人","target":"自身","area":"","effect":"","duration":"12 小時或直到醒來","saving_throw":"","spell_resistance":"","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"你設置一項具體的條件，當條件滿足時你能自動醒來。\n這種條件可以是“如果任何超過微型的生物靠近到我 10 尺內”或是“當月亮升到最高\n點時”，條件必須是你在清醒時能觀測到的，因此你不能讓法術在他處發生某事時喚醒你，也\n不能在一個隱形的敵人偷襲你的營地時喚醒你，你醒來時滿懷警惕並為立刻行動做好了準備。","description_en":null,"source_pages":[1085,1085],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":[],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"a8cc10ee4cb5db82c3a6460f905058d649598f3163a11fb0ec378e714d5fb119","heading":"警醒睡眠（Vigilant Slumber) （完美巫師）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
