{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHJFZ5SVK9GPMJ7K26P5","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHJFMKV48GEF19ERWE5V","name_zh":"邪靈術","name_en":"Vile Death","alphabet":"V","source_access":{"kind":"expansion","sources":["萬法大全"],"explicit_sources":["萬法大全"],"inferred_sources":[],"raw_source_labels":["萬法大全"],"default_character_creation":false},"levels":[{"class":"牧師","level":9,"note":""},{"class":"術士/法師","level":9,"note":""}],"level_text_raw":"牧師 9，術士/法師 9","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"咒法系","subschool":"呼喚","descriptors":["邪惡"],"components":"Ｖ、Ｓ、Ｍ、ＸＰ","casting_time":"1 個小時","range":"接觸","target":"一個實體不死生物","area":"","effect":"","duration":"永久（D）","saving_throw":"無","spell_resistance":"有","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"大地在你的腳邊裂開一道縫隙，你可以隱約聽見人們痛苦的慘叫。腐穢的紅光從裂縫\n中放射出來，逐漸形成一個惡魔的形象。 在惡魔的笑聲中，裂縫漸漸關閉，然後紅光形成\n的惡魔變成了受術不死生物的形象。然後紅光形成的形象逐漸滲入受術的不死生物之中。\n你自九層地獄或者無底深淵中召喚煉獄的精魂，並且將它結附在一個實體不死生物上\n——如波達屍、囚魂魔、妖鬼、食屍鬼、魔魂屍、木乃伊、夜影、骷髏、吸血鬼、吸血衍\n體、屍妖以及僵屍。\n結附惡魔會給受術帶來煉獄生物範本（怪物圖鑒 108）。受術不死生物對你的態度不會\n因為這個法術而改變。\n施法材料：一小塊硫磺、一塊價值至少 500gp 的雞血石。","description_en":null,"source_pages":[1086,1087],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":[],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"c3e980686ff933b243e1e8c1c7756483388b8900a879a999fc1d062e3f0551c0","heading":"邪靈術（Vile Death）（萬法大全）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHJFHVMEVTN5RB8ZTS02","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHJF801DNMFA6742XJ8Y","name_zh":"蔓藤源泉","name_en":"Vine Mine","alphabet":"V","source_access":{"kind":"expansion","sources":["萬法大全"],"explicit_sources":["萬法大全"],"inferred_sources":[],"raw_source_labels":["萬法大全"],"default_character_creation":false},"levels":[{"class":"德魯伊","level":3,"note":""}],"level_text_raw":"德魯伊 3","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"咒法系","subschool":"創造","descriptors":[],"components":"Ｖ、Ｓ、Ｍ","casting_time":"一個標準動作","range":"中距（100 英尺+10 英尺/每等級）","target":"","area":"半徑 10 尺擴散","effect":"","duration":"10 分鐘/每等級","saving_throw":"見說明","spell_resistance":"可","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"你抓著常春藤做的葉冠，祈求自然之力，植物聽命而起，覆蓋整塊土地。\n你創造並且引導迅速生長的藤蔓。當你使用這個法術的時候，選擇下列效果中的一個：\n· 輔助攀爬（視作綁好的繩子）\n· 捆綁無助的目標（逃脫檢定的 DC 為 25）\n· 阻礙移動（視為灌木叢生地形）\n· 偽裝（在躲藏檢定上獲得+4 表現加值）\n以一個標準動作，你可以使蔓藤生長（可以藉此來改變效果）\n施法材料：一個常春藤做的葉冠","description_en":null,"source_pages":[1087,1087],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":[],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"b4175ba7a1917f33a5db567d20bd836e1d4a8d814986aa9f65ee02df5327dd98","heading":"蔓藤源泉（Vine Mine）（萬法大全）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHJGY75S1AZ4D4M62FPH","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHJGRFW5WCS31RAK1KBV","name_zh":"打擊藤蔓","name_en":"Vine Strike","alphabet":"V","source_access":{"kind":"expansion","sources":["完美冒險","萬法大全"],"explicit_sources":["完美冒險","萬法大全"],"inferred_sources":[],"raw_source_labels":["完美冒險","萬法大全"],"default_character_creation":false},"levels":[{"class":"巡林客","level":1,"note":""},{"class":"德魯伊","level":1,"note":""}],"level_text_raw":"德魯伊 1，巡林客 1","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"預言系","subschool":"","descriptors":[],"components":"V、DF","casting_time":"迅捷動作","range":"個人","target":"自己","area":"","effect":"","duration":"1 輪","saving_throw":"","spell_resistance":"","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"你輕吟咒語，視野暫時變成了模糊的暗綠色。一眨眼後，模糊消失，你感到與自然的一\n股新的聯繫，它告訴你進攻的部位。\n當法術生效時，你與自然力量建立起特殊的連接，使你能夠偷襲植物生物，就如同他們不\n免疫偷襲一樣。但是在偷襲植物生物的時候，你仍然要滿足普通偷襲的其它要求。\n這個法術只在偷襲傷害上有效。它不會給你對植物造成重擊的能力或者擊破植物生物傷害\n減免以及其他防護的能力。","description_en":null,"source_pages":[1087,1088],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":[],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"5be5365301a02a9a6c517e1658f46a5c43b527bb7b3a79e5e331414d30cf272d","heading":"打擊藤蔓（Vine Strike）（萬法大全）（完美冒險）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHJGW44HS4GPMCFB7HK8","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHJGM687XFF7S841VQTY","name_zh":"毒蛇群聚","name_en":"Vipergout","alphabet":"V","source_access":{"kind":"expansion","sources":["萬法大全"],"explicit_sources":["萬法大全"],"inferred_sources":[],"raw_source_labels":["萬法大全"],"default_character_creation":false},"levels":[{"class":"術士/法師","level":3,"note":""}],"level_text_raw":"術士/法師 3","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"咒法系","subschool":"呼喚","descriptors":["見說明"],"components":"Ｖ，Ｓ，Ｍ","casting_time":"一個標準動作","range":"近距（25 英尺+5 英尺/每 2 等級）","target":"","area":"","effect":"1d4+3 個召喚生物","duration":"1 輪/等級","saving_throw":"無","spell_resistance":"可","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"當你完成這個法術的時候，你感受到一陣劇烈的反胃。 一些東西從你的喉嚨湧出，最\n終你嘔出一條條毒蛇。\n這個法術可以召喚出 1d4+3 條天界或者煉獄中型毒蛇。它們從你的口中竄出，去攻擊\n你的敵人。\n一條被這個法術召喚的天界毒蛇有強酸、寒冷、電擊抗力 5，法術抗力 7 以及一次在傷\n害骰上有+2 加值的破邪斬。\n一條被這個法術召喚的天界毒蛇有強酸、火焰抗力 5，法術抗力 7 以及一次在傷害骰上\n有+2 加值的破善斬。\n從你完成這個法術的輪開始，你可以以一個標準動作嘔出 3 條毒蛇或者以一個類移動\n動作嘔出 1 條毒蛇（即，如果你移動以後施展這個法術，你只能從下一輪開始吐出毒蛇；\n如果你在移動之前施展這個法術，那麼法術完成後你可以在這輪吐出 1 條 毒 蛇 。）。被嘔出\n的毒蛇會落在你的腳邊由你指定的格子中。並且他們會在同一輪中 你的行動階段行動，與\n怪物召喚術相同。\n這些蛇並不是真正存在於你的口中，因此他們不會阻止你呼吸。但是除非你吐完所有\n被這個法術召喚的蛇，你不能說話，使用需要語言成分的法術，啟動需要口令的物品。當\n法術結束時，所有被召喚的蛇都會消失並且還沒有吐出來的蛇也會不見。\n當你使用呼喚子學派的法術召喚善良或者邪惡生物時，這個法術就視為相應的陣營。\n施法材料：一塊蛇皮","description_en":null,"source_pages":[1088,1088],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":[],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"603ed98ba122b03fa7eaf9c3a7cc35fc5d30c6d570abd5c14a5e0d5262eb9a29","heading":"毒蛇群聚（Vipergout）（萬法大全）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHJGJYEDC7Q4C93PAF55","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHJGBGFC7W9K5KYZNJSB","name_zh":"恩賜","name_en":"Virtue","alphabet":"V","source_access":{"kind":"basic","sources":[],"explicit_sources":[],"inferred_sources":[],"raw_source_labels":[],"default_character_creation":true},"levels":[{"class":"德魯伊","level":0,"note":""},{"class":"牧師","level":0,"note":""},{"class":"聖武士","level":1,"note":""}],"level_text_raw":"牧師 0，德魯伊 0，聖武士 1","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"變化系","subschool":"","descriptors":[],"components":"言語，姿勢，法器","casting_time":"1 個標準動作","range":"接觸","target":"被接觸的生物","area":"","effect":"","duration":"1 分鐘","saving_throw":"意志，通過則無效（無害）","spell_resistance":"可（無害）","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"受術者獲得 1 點暫時生命值。","description_en":null,"source_pages":[1088,1089],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":[],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"0ea0a74f807f7ccb7fa65b583c14c0476ecb1e02691b79c3229f167960b65a3e","heading":"恩賜（Virtue）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHJGG983T9TTZGBE6Z3B","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHJG9PA79GESADYTBYEZ","name_zh":"神之面容","name_en":"Visage Of The Deity","alphabet":"V","source_access":{"kind":"expansion","sources":["萬法大全"],"explicit_sources":["萬法大全"],"inferred_sources":[],"raw_source_labels":["萬法大全"],"default_character_creation":false},"levels":[{"class":"牧師","level":6,"note":""},{"class":"神秘","level":6,"note":""}],"level_text_raw":"牧師 6，神秘 6","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"變化系","subschool":"","descriptors":["邪惡或者善良"],"components":"","casting_time":"","range":"","target":"","area":"","effect":"","duration":"","saving_throw":"","spell_resistance":"","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"這個法術的功能與 次級神之面容 類似，除了你獲得許多下列的天界或者煉獄生物特\n質。\n· 你獲得光輝閃亮的形象（善良牧師）或者變得兇神惡煞（邪惡牧師）。\n· 你獲得每天一次破邪斬（善良牧師）或者破善斬（邪惡牧師）。使用時，在攻擊相對\n陣營目標時將你的魅力加值加到你的攻擊檢定上並且將你的角色等級加到傷害檢定上。\n· 你獲得 60 尺黑暗視覺。\n· 你獲得強酸、寒冷、電擊抗力 20（善良牧師）或者寒冷、火焰抗力 20（邪惡牧師）。\n· 你獲得傷害減免 10/魔法。\n· 你獲得法術抗力 20。\n你不會因此變成異界生物。","description_en":null,"source_pages":[1089,1089],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":[],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"d47c8703191a17a2df05bbdfe84258799ad380f20b23106f7bb793b0da61e05a","heading":"神之面容（Visage Of The Deity）（萬法大全）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHJGMV5ZP2D5BJC0ZS48","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHJGPE0TZBQH07G0F76D","name_zh":"高等神之面容","name_en":"Visage Of The Deity,Greater","alphabet":"V","source_access":{"kind":"expansion","sources":["萬法大全"],"explicit_sources":["萬法大全"],"inferred_sources":[],"raw_source_labels":["萬法大全"],"default_character_creation":false},"levels":[{"class":"淨化","level":9,"note":""},{"class":"牧師","level":9,"note":""},{"class":"神秘","level":9,"note":""},{"class":"競爭","level":9,"note":""}],"level_text_raw":"牧師 9，競爭 9，神秘 9，淨化 9","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"變化系","subschool":"","descriptors":["邪惡或者善良"],"components":"","casting_time":"","range":"","target":"","area":"","effect":"","duration":"","saving_throw":"","spell_resistance":"","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"這個法術與次等神之面容類似，除了它會帶給你許多半天界/半煉獄生物的特質。\n你的生物類型在法術持續其間變成異界生物。不同於其它異界生物，你可以被復活。\n善良牧師有如下變化：\n· 你長出羽翼，使你獲得兩倍于你正常速度的飛行速度（機動性良好）。\n· 你獲得+1 天生防護。\n· 你獲得微光視覺。\n· 你獲得強酸、寒冷、電擊抗力 10。\n· 你免疫疾病。\n· 你在對抗毒素的豁免檢定中獲得+4 種族加值。\n· 你獲得傷害減免 10/魔法。\n· 你獲得法術抗力 25\n· 你獲得如下屬性加值：+4 力量，+2 敏捷，+4 體質，+2 智力，+4 感知，+4 魅力。\n邪惡牧師有如下變化\n· 你長出皮翼，使你獲得兩倍于你正常速度的飛行速度（機動性普通）。\n· 你獲得+1 天生防護。\n· 你獲得齧咬、爪抓攻擊。如果你的體型是中型或者更大，齧咬造成 1d6 點傷害、爪\n抓 造成 1d4 點傷害。如果你的體型是小型，齧咬造成 1d4 點傷害，爪抓造成 1d3 點傷害。\n· 你獲得 60 尺黑暗視覺。\n· 你獲得強酸、寒冷、電擊、火焰抗力 10。\n· 你免疫毒素。\n· 你在對抗毒素的豁免檢定中獲得+4 種族加值。\n· 你獲得傷害減免 10/魔法。\n· 你獲得法術抗力 25\n· 你獲得如下屬性加值：+4 力 量，+2 敏捷 ，+4 體質，+2 智 力，+4 感知 ，+4 魅力 。","description_en":null,"source_pages":[1089,1089],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":[],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"65e934b3377b44c325b36ba40e85e6bc7766d76c1cb6ec815c7033ab7144eca4","heading":"高等神之面容（Visage Of The Deity,Greater）（萬法大全）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHJGH9GMYNWB0HDEEK3V","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHJG1X6D9556NQG5197M","name_zh":"次級神之面容","name_en":"Visage Of The Deity,Lesser","alphabet":"V","source_access":{"kind":"expansion","sources":["完美神力","萬法大全"],"explicit_sources":["完美神力","萬法大全"],"inferred_sources":[],"raw_source_labels":["完美神力","萬法大全"],"default_character_creation":false},"levels":[{"class":"牧師","level":3,"note":""},{"class":"神秘","level":3,"note":""},{"class":"聖武士","level":4,"note":""},{"class":"黑暗衛士","level":4,"note":""}],"level_text_raw":"黑暗衛士 4，牧師 3，神秘 3，聖武士 4","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"變化系","subschool":"","descriptors":["邪惡或者善良"],"components":"Ｖ、Ｓ、ＤＦ","casting_time":"一個標準動作","range":"個人","target":"自己","area":"","effect":"","duration":"1 輪/每等級","saving_throw":"","spell_resistance":"","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"當你完成祈禱，你感到神的手指撫摸了你。 你的外形反映出她神聖的力量，並且她的\n撫摸給與你抵抗某些傷害的力量。\n你的魅力獲得+4 增強加值。你也會獲得強酸、寒冷、電擊抗力 10 如果你是善良陣營，\n或者獲得火焰、寒冷抗力 10 如果你是邪惡陣營。","description_en":null,"source_pages":[1090,1090],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":[],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"8d90386133415ce0306971e2b82b298e0a9d7abbb75a2c4e4c57dafce96f70e5","heading":"次級神之面容（Visage Of The Deity,Lesser）（萬法大全）（完美神力）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHJG7CHJV908DVB1E7FR","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHJGQ141FF1RAAS0NNXG","name_zh":"粘滯膠團","name_en":"Viscid Glob","alphabet":"V","source_access":{"kind":"expansion","sources":["萬法大全"],"explicit_sources":["萬法大全"],"inferred_sources":[],"raw_source_labels":["萬法大全"],"default_character_creation":false},"levels":[{"class":"術士/法師","level":5,"note":""}],"level_text_raw":"術士/法師 5","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"咒法系","subschool":"","descriptors":[],"components":"Ｖ、Ｓ、Ｍ","casting_time":"一個標準動作","range":"中距（100 英尺+10 英尺/每等級）","target":"一個生物","area":"","effect":"","duration":"1 小時/等級","saving_throw":"反射，通過則無效","spell_resistance":"可","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"你念出咒語，拋出一個絲質小球。 小球離手之後變成直徑 5 英尺的又濕又粘的膠團向\n目標飛射而去。\n當你用粘滯膠團攻擊時，你做遠程接觸檢定。如果你失誤，膠團可能會命中別的生物\n或者附近的格子（參考 投擲武器失手 PH158）。一旦你確定失手，擲 1d4 來決定落點離目\n標格子的距離。\n任何被膠團擊中的中型或者更小型的生物必須立即做反射豁免以避免立即被粘在那\n裡。被粘住的生物只可以說話或者做只需要心靈的動作（如施展不需要姿勢和材料成 分的\n法術）並且只能夠以整輪動作進行力量或者逃脫檢定（DC 為該法術 DC）來掙脫。大型或\n者更大的生物被粘住時，只是不能移動，其他動作則不受影響。\n在法術結束，膠團消失之前，膠團都會保持粘性。因此任何碰到膠團的生物（例如想\n要拉出同伴的生物）必須通過一個反射檢定來避免被粘住。像這樣接觸而被粘住的生物並\n不會像完全被擊中的粘住地生物那樣難以逃脫，因此，掙脫它所要進行的力量或者逃脫檢\n定的 DC 會減少 5。\n施法材料：一個蜘蛛絲做的小球","description_en":null,"source_pages":[1090,1090],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":[],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"b4605f8ef339039d1c9f42e8c4d9b27ad844d00ae5c34013585a3475e607bbe3","heading":"粘滯膠團（Viscid Glob）（萬法大全）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHJHM0AKPYHADBNBYWKY","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHJH8J5Q6NGKM0PFMD2E","name_zh":"靈視","name_en":"Vision","alphabet":"V","source_access":{"kind":"basic","sources":[],"explicit_sources":[],"inferred_sources":[],"raw_source_labels":[],"default_character_creation":true},"levels":[{"class":"術士/法師","level":7,"note":""}],"level_text_raw":"術士/法師 7","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"預言系","subschool":"","descriptors":[],"components":"言語，姿勢，材料，經驗值","casting_time":"1 個標準動作","range":"","target":"","area":"","effect":"","duration":"","saving_throw":"","spell_resistance":"","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"和通曉傳奇（legend lore）一樣，但更快也更費力。你可以提出一個關於某人、某地或\n某物的問題，然後施展此法術。若你就在該物體或該人邊上，或者就在該地點，那麼通過\nDC20 的施法者等級檢定（1D20+1 每施法者等級；最多+25），你可以得到關於它的一個幻\n景。若僅僅知道該人、該物、該地的詳細資訊，則 DC 為 25。若只是聽到些傳聞，並沒有\n完整資訊，則 DC 為 30，且只能得到含糊的資訊。\n消耗經驗值：100 點。","description_en":null,"source_pages":[1090,1091],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":[],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"fc81d1fcd999e536e7979c1ca59c052015c10a3bd43bb218af479281cd50b828","heading":"靈視（Vision）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHJHMRAW1R3T78TRKS28","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHJHFP8HXCG6YEXYPSYM","name_zh":"光榮之視","name_en":"Vision Of Glory","alphabet":"V","source_access":{"kind":"expansion","sources":["萬法大全"],"explicit_sources":["萬法大全"],"inferred_sources":[],"raw_source_labels":["萬法大全"],"default_character_creation":false},"levels":[{"class":"牧師","level":1,"note":""},{"class":"聖武士","level":1,"note":""}],"level_text_raw":"牧師 1，聖武士 1","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"預言系","subschool":"","descriptors":[],"components":"Ｖ、Ｓ、ＤＦ","casting_time":"一個標準動作","range":"接觸","target":"一個被接觸的生物","area":"","effect":"","duration":"1 分鐘或者直到能量散發","saving_throw":"無","spell_resistance":"可","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"你接觸你的同伴，她的雙眼暫時變得朦朧。 你知道她看見了她的神要求她以神的名義\n而戰。\n你給予受術者一個短暫的神聖影像，使他獲得鼓舞。受術生物在一次豁免檢定上獲得\n等於你魅力調整值的士氣加值。受術者必須要在某一次豁免檢定擲骰前宣告使用這個加值。\n使用這個加值會使能量散發。","description_en":null,"source_pages":[1092,1092],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":[],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"3b2f51ff71385792216578d7ffad7a17308ea9a97745a183023c81acfadc089b","heading":"光榮之視（Vision Of Glory）（萬法大全）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHJHBDQ827KFTN5DV6CX","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHJHF03VZE9G8PZC2QA7","name_zh":"天庭幻景","name_en":"Vision Of Heaven","alphabet":"V","source_access":{"kind":"expansion","sources":["好人書"],"explicit_sources":["好人書"],"inferred_sources":[],"raw_source_labels":["好人書"],"default_character_creation":false},"levels":[{"class":"和平使者","level":1,"note":""},{"class":"喜樂","level":1,"note":""},{"class":"多米尼爾的屠戮者","level":1,"note":""},{"class":"天族","level":1,"note":""},{"class":"崇善秘法師","level":1,"note":""},{"class":"牧師","level":1,"note":""}],"level_text_raw":"和平使者 1，牧師 1，天族 1，崇善秘法師 1，喜樂 1，多米尼爾的屠戮者 1","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"附魔系","subschool":"","descriptors":["善良","影響心靈"],"components":"言語","casting_time":"一個標準動作","range":"近距（25 呎+5 呎/每兩等級）","target":"一個邪惡生物","area":"","effect":"","duration":"一輪","saving_throw":"意志通過則無效","spell_resistance":"可","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"你的字語讓目標生物暫時瞥見了來自天界七山的祝福與喜樂，使他在那個片刻為自己\n的惡行而感到震驚及懊悔。\n在接下來的一整輪，目標生物會處於暈眩狀態。此外，由於生物受到那將要到來的救\n贖所感動，在接下來的 24 小時內，在面對救贖（見好人書第二章）時，它的意志檢定會受\n到-1 減值。","description_en":null,"source_pages":[1091,1091],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":[],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"a7e8ae92b5993c46d1d193c5348e5d427834461c20b789c757b79f8f8d59299f","heading":"天庭幻景（Vision Of Heaven ）（好人書）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHJHTYE544MAKKA13CN4","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHJHPX1AENTSDQ2P23R2","name_zh":"全知之眼","name_en":"Vision Of The Omniscient Eye","alphabet":"V","source_access":{"kind":"unresolved_expansion","sources":["龍之魔法"],"explicit_sources":[],"inferred_sources":["龍之魔法"],"raw_source_labels":[],"default_character_creation":false},"levels":[{"class":"吟游詩人","level":3,"note":""},{"class":"德魯伊","level":3,"note":""},{"class":"牧師","level":3,"note":""},{"class":"術士/法師","level":3,"note":""}],"level_text_raw":"吟游詩人 3，牧師 3，德魯伊 3，術士/法師 3","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"預言/塑能［光］","subschool":"","descriptors":[],"components":"言語，姿勢","casting_time":"一個標準動作","range":"個人","target":"你","area":"","effect":"","duration":"1 分鐘/等級","saving_throw":"","spell_resistance":"","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"你的眼中短暫地閃過明亮的光芒，它使你的心靈向附近的每個物體開放。\n你獲得巨大的視野，它允許你清楚地看到周圍區域的一切。你在偵察檢定上獲得+10 洞\n察加值並對致聾和致盲免疫（如果你已經致聾或致盲，在該法術的持續時間內你能正常觀\n看）。\n此外，如果你在識破隱形、真知術、或任何其它允許你看到隱形生物的法術的有效期間 施\n放該法術，你還能通過一個迅捷動作對 60 英尺以內的任何隱形的生物或物體施展一次妖\n火效果（如同同名法術）。這樣做會立刻結束全知之眼的持續時間；妖火效果持續 1 分鐘。\n特殊：學會了該法術的角色在偵察檢定上獲得+1 表現加值。","description_en":null,"source_pages":[1091,1091],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":["source_inferred_not_relational"],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"938c39f0fd48ee592b27f34c447ef0541755a304ade92aa91fed3a018c753684","heading":"全知之眼（Vision Of The Omniscient Eye）（龍之魔法）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHJH3TJFNKXNBV9X8RM4","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHJH4HTXCBD7SFXH5SQK","name_zh":"預察未來之視","name_en":"Visions Of The Future","alphabet":"V","source_access":{"kind":"expansion","sources":["PHB2"],"explicit_sources":["PHB2"],"inferred_sources":[],"raw_source_labels":["PHB2"],"default_character_creation":false},"levels":[{"class":"牧師","level":8,"note":""}],"level_text_raw":"牧師 8","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"預言系","subschool":"","descriptors":[],"components":"言語、姿勢","casting_time":"10 分鐘","range":"個人","target":"你自己","area":"","effect":"","duration":"1 小時/每等級或直到能量發散","saving_throw":"","spell_resistance":"","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"你在事件發生前就已瞥見其結果，讓你有足夠的時間來改變它。\n你的所有豁免檢定得到+2 聖力加值，防禦等級得到+2 閃避加值。在法術持續時間內，\n你有一次的機會能選擇用直覺動作解消法術來得到更高的加值。 當你用這種方式解消法術\n時，豁免檢定得到的聖力加值與防禦等級的閃避加值為你施法者等級的二分之一（最多到\n+25）。這個加值會在你的下一回合開始時消失。","description_en":null,"source_pages":[1091,1092],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":[],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"bb72806cfc961c4421122b534b916c8f97217a531ea0387eb48d54030fd6721b","heading":"預察未來之視（Visions Of The Future）（PHB2）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHJFBTZKGRR7KFMY99CX","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHJFJC16C9VD7RJEK8CD","name_zh":"致死打擊","name_en":"Vital Strike","alphabet":"V","source_access":{"kind":"expansion","sources":["完美巫師"],"explicit_sources":["完美巫師"],"inferred_sources":[],"raw_source_labels":["完美巫師"],"default_character_creation":false},"levels":[{"class":"刺客","level":3,"note":""}],"level_text_raw":"刺客 3","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"預言系","subschool":"","descriptors":[],"components":"S","casting_time":"一個迅捷動作","range":"個人","target":"自身","area":"","effect":"","duration":"一次攻擊","saving_throw":"","spell_resistance":"","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"你獲得臨時看穿對手行動的能力，你在下一輪行動結束前的下一次攻擊骰被視為偷襲，\n即使你的對手沒有措手不及或遭到夾擊，這道法術不會讓你偷襲原本免疫偷襲的生物，也無法\n讓你在偷襲時使用其他能力來獲得額外的好處（例如某些專長）。","description_en":null,"source_pages":[1087,1087],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":[],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"48d5af874fb8bb7a009c768c49b96cd149e941516c4a795ac0efcfae4f711199","heading":"致死打擊（Vital Strike)（完美巫師）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHJHF11G3FK0T508EK9N","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHJHYWK3AHZNTZMHJ52A","name_zh":"璃化術","name_en":"Vitrify","alphabet":"V","source_access":{"kind":"expansion","sources":["沙暴之書"],"explicit_sources":["沙暴之書"],"inferred_sources":[],"raw_source_labels":["沙暴之書"],"default_character_creation":false},"levels":[{"class":"沙領域","level":7,"note":""},{"class":"術士/法師","level":7,"note":""}],"level_text_raw":"沙領域 7，術士/法師 7","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"變化系","subschool":"","descriptors":["土"],"components":"V，S，M/DF","casting_time":"1 個標準動作","range":"中距（100 英尺+10 呎/等級）","target":"","area":"每 5 施法者等級至多 1 個 10 尺立方體（S）","effect":"","duration":"永久","saving_throw":"見下文","spell_resistance":"無","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"這個法術將任何深度的普通沙子轉化為玻璃。沙子瞬間被加熱到熔點，然後慢慢變硬變\n成新的形態。在沙子上方或內部的物體都會沉入熱玻璃中。生物可以通過一個成功的反射豁免\n在區域變化前逃開。豁免失敗，且無法漂浮、飛行、或以其他方式從熔融玻璃中脫離的生物，\n其速度降為 5 英尺，並在攻擊檢定和 AC 上得到-2 罰值。土系亞種生物每輪可以在熔融玻璃\n中緩慢移動 10 英尺。如果一個生物只有部分身體（如站在區域邊緣的大型或更大的生\n物），雖然他仍然需要承受全部傷害，但其速度只降低一半（而不是降至 5 英尺）。\n掉入熔融玻璃中的生物第一輪受到 10d6 點火焰傷害。材料冷卻需要花費 10 輪。每一\n輪，傷害骰因玻璃冷卻減少了一個，直到不造成傷害。\n玻璃在第六輪變得足夠堅實以困住生物。無法在玻璃硬化之前逃離的生物被困於其中，\n必須擊破玻璃逃生。因此受困的生物可以通過力量檢定打破玻璃或對玻璃造成傷害來逃離。\n玻璃硬度為 1，每英寸厚度+1，擊破 DC 為 12，每英寸厚度+1。身體有一部分被困於玻璃中\n的生物受到-2 攻擊檢定減值，以及-4 敏捷減值，並無法移動。\n打破玻璃時，每當一個生物攻擊玻璃成功，就會受到破裂玻璃對其造成的 1d6 點傷害。\n如果由他人打破玻璃，生物需要因碎玻璃受到 1d6 點傷害。\n一個被困在玻璃內部的生物可能開始窒息（見地下城主指南第 304 頁）。\n奧術施法材料：一顆小玻璃彈珠。","description_en":null,"source_pages":[1092,1093],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":[],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"28ce3b2e6fd4f8f6e8ea675ce28cb34226da5e4b454c8041c95f1b8fb7991cc0","heading":"璃化術（Vitrify）（沙暴之書）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHJHCGZCHS0TBF4QP157","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHJHST1CBF00MQBT91NY","name_zh":"硫酸法球","name_en":"Vitriolic Sphere","alphabet":"V","source_access":{"kind":"expansion","sources":["完美奧術","萬法大全"],"explicit_sources":["完美奧術","萬法大全"],"inferred_sources":[],"raw_source_labels":["完美奧術","萬法大全"],"default_character_creation":false},"levels":[{"class":"巫覡","level":5,"note":""},{"class":"術士/法師","level":5,"note":""}],"level_text_raw":"術士/法師 5，巫覡 5","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"咒法系","subschool":"創造","descriptors":["強酸"],"components":"言語、姿勢、材料","casting_time":"一個標準動作","range":"遠距（400 尺+40 尺/每等級）","target":"10 英尺爆發半徑","area":"","effect":"","duration":"立即；見說明","saving_throw":"反射，通過則無效以及反射，通過則減半；見說明","spell_resistance":"不可","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"完美奧術：你創造出一個嘶鳴的翡翠色球體，它會用強酸腐蝕區域內的所有。受影響的\n生物會受到施法者每等級 1d4 的強酸傷害（最大 15d4）並且除非通過反射豁免否則在接下\n來的兩輪中會受到後續傷害（6d4 並在下一輪為 3d4）。任何一輪的後續傷害都可以通過反\n射豁免以減半。若生物通過了第二輪的豁免，它便不會在第三輪中受到強酸傷害。\n萬法大全：受影響的生物受到 6d6 點強酸傷害。通過反射檢定的生物受到一半傷害。\n沒有通過的生物受到全部傷害並且在接下來的 2 輪內每輪受到 6d6 點傷害。\n施法材料：一份小玻璃瓶裝的王水。","description_en":null,"source_pages":[1093,1093],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":[],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"c2ddfc4728e1938803dd31b6764e446c81ea59affd4805b279ee8239c7724647","heading":"硫酸法球（Vitriolic Sphere）（完美奧術）（萬法大全）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHJHMD9EKNM31T3CFZ1F","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHJHA00H4B2XCPHT20PV","name_zh":"龍言術","name_en":"Voice Of The Dragon","alphabet":"V","source_access":{"kind":"expansion","sources":["巨龍書","萬法大全"],"explicit_sources":["巨龍書","萬法大全"],"inferred_sources":[],"raw_source_labels":["巨龍書","萬法大全"],"default_character_creation":false},"levels":[{"class":"吟游詩人","level":4,"note":""},{"class":"術士/法師","level":4,"note":""},{"class":"龍","level":4,"note":""}],"level_text_raw":"吟游詩人 4，龍 4，術士/法師 4","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"變化系","subschool":"","descriptors":[],"components":"Ｖ、Ｓ","casting_time":"一個標準動作","range":"個人","target":"自己","area":"","effect":"","duration":"10 分鐘/每等級（D）","saving_throw":"","spell_resistance":"","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"當你念出咒語做出手勢以後，你的聲音變得深沉而有力使聆聽者感到威嚴、力量和深\n邃。\n你在唬騙、交涉、威嚇上獲得獲得+10 增強加值。並且你也能夠說以及理解（但不能看\n懂）龍語。\n在法術結束前，你可以使用標準動作來給一個目標產生暗示效果，其效果同暗示\n（PH285），包括距離、持續時間和其他效果。如果你這樣做，龍言術效果結束，但是暗示\n的效果仍然按照正常情況持續下去。\n特殊：術士使用這個法術的時候，施法者等級+1。","description_en":null,"source_pages":[1093,1093],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":[],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"3f04157e01b7c9e29a883afcaabfcd3a48c229390b8d78264825c53872a06345","heading":"龍言術（Voice Of The Dragon）（萬法大全）（巨龍書）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHJJPCAGDBTFEG70JNS3","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHJJHFJF6FR3W2EGVW4T","name_zh":"利齒旋風","name_en":"Vortex Of Teeth","alphabet":"V","source_access":{"kind":"expansion","sources":["萬法大全"],"explicit_sources":["萬法大全"],"inferred_sources":[],"raw_source_labels":["萬法大全"],"default_character_creation":false},"levels":[{"class":"德魯伊","level":4,"note":""},{"class":"術士/法師","level":4,"note":""}],"level_text_raw":"德魯伊 4，術士/法師 4","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"塑能系","subschool":"","descriptors":["力場"],"components":"Ｖ、Ｓ、Ｍ","casting_time":"一個標準動作","range":"中距（100 英尺+10 英尺/每等級）","target":"","area":"中空的圓柱體（半徑 40 英尺，20 英尺高，中心有半徑 5 英尺的安全區域）","effect":"","duration":"1 輪/每等級（D）","saving_throw":"無","spell_resistance":"可","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"一大群半透明的食人魚環繞著你指定的地方高速遊動。 這些力場構成的魔法魚狼吞虎\n嚥地穿透生物的身軀。\n在範圍內的生物在你的回合開始時受到每輪 3d8 點傷害。因為這個法術產生的是力場\n效果，所以它可以對虛體造成傷害。","description_en":null,"source_pages":[1093,1094],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":[],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"e31198dd3833180b91271ae2e946e2444e68577c706bd5561e4b8e2aefd80e94","heading":"利齒旋風（Vortex Of Teeth）（萬法大全）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHJJAHWTHR2N6T8AQHRT","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHJJ8HVTGSYHDAY65PQR","name_zh":"畏懼傷害","name_en":"Vulnerability","alphabet":"V","source_access":{"kind":"expansion","sources":["巨龍書","萬法大全"],"explicit_sources":["巨龍書","萬法大全"],"inferred_sources":[],"raw_source_labels":["巨龍書","萬法大全"],"default_character_creation":false},"levels":[{"class":"刺客","level":4,"note":""},{"class":"牧師","level":5,"note":""},{"class":"術士/法師","level":5,"note":""}],"level_text_raw":"刺客 4，牧師 5，術士/法師 5","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"變化系","subschool":"","descriptors":[],"components":"Ｖ、Ｓ","casting_time":"一個標準動作","range":"接觸","target":"一個你接觸到的生物","area":"","effect":"","duration":"1 輪/每等級","saving_throw":"意志，通過則無效","spell_resistance":"可","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"你召喚法術的力量，一股紫色的霧環繞的你的目標，使他神奇的防護變弱。\n這個法術降低目標 5 點傷害減免（最小為 5）。譬如你向一條有傷害減免 10/魔法的龍施\n展這個法術，那麼他的傷害減免會變為 5/魔法。\n每比 11 級高 4 等級，你可以多降低 5 點傷害減免，15 級時你可以降低 10 點，19 級時\n你可以降低 15 點。","description_en":null,"source_pages":[1094,1095],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":[],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"93faad3ca71ba1f31a814b32028b38f29e337453caedc30fbca18d2fdaf5203d","heading":"畏懼傷害（Vulnerability）（萬法大全）（巨龍書）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
